@engineering.dry

Purpose:
  Don't repeat yourself.

UseWhen:
  - same logic appears multiple times
  - change in one place should affect all
  - duplication causes bugs

AvoidWhen:
  - duplication is intentional and safe
  - coupling would be worse than duplication

Why:
  Every piece of knowledge must have a single representation.

Exception:
  If merging introduces stronger coupling, intentional duplication is acceptable.

Related:
  @engineering.kiss
  @engineering.composition-over-inheritance

Examples:
  @project.payment
  @project.order

State: +
